{"articleNo":"150419","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=150419&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"연수원 명칭 확정 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.04.25","hit":"2722","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">5</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">월 개원예정인 우리 대학교 연수원의 정식 명칭을 다음과 같이 확정하였음을</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">알려드니 향후 연수원 시설 이용에 적극 협조하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><!--StartFragment--></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">가</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">연수원명 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">『</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">금오공과대학교 해오름연수원</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">』</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;ㅇ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">명칭 의미 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -89pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">동해 해오름을 볼 수 있는 공간이며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">연수를 통해 금오의 용솟음 치는 기상을 다져 온누리를 밝힘</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -87.8pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">금오는 태양의 이명이며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">연수원에서 동해 해오름을 항상 볼 수 있어</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">변하지 않는 모습과 타오르는 열정을 의미</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">명칭 결정 경과</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">공모전 실시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">[</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">4. 1.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) ~ 4. 10.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)] : 79</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">명 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">79</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">건 접수</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp; 2) 1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">차 심사 실시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(4.15) : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">연수원 명칭 후보 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">21</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">건 선정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp; 3) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">본부보직자회의 최종 명칭 확정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(4.22).&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">끝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
